{"id":"e7acf5d437592730","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-tisp.md","title":"同一算法的联合时间空间界","display":"df-tisp — 同一算法的联合时间空间界","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-tisp","aliases":["28-df-tisp"],"display":"df-tisp — 同一算法的联合时间空间界","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 5.11 (definition of TISP)","source_printed_pages":"101","source_pdf_pages":"127","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-tisp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-tisp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tisp — 同一算法的联合时间空间界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 5.11 (definition of TISP)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"101"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"127"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(T,S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M,\\operatorname{space}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M,\\operatorname{space}_M\\)</span> 见所列本地定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TISP}(T,S)\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\left[L=L(M)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\left(\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le cT(|x|)\\land\\operatorname{space}_M(x)\\le cS(|x|)\\right)\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TISP}(T,S)\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\left[L=L(M)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\left(\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le cT(|x|)\\land\\operatorname{space}_M(x)\\le cS(|x|)\\right)\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>时间与空间必须由同一台固定机器同时达到；分别存在两台机器满足各自界，只能得到DTIME(T)∩DSPACE(S)，不等于本定义。这里沿用逐格多带模型，不自动增加RAM操作。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 5.11 (definition of TISP)；印刷 pp.101 / PDF pp.127。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"L(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_M,\\operatorname{space}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TISP}(T,S)\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\left[L=L(M)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\left(\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le cT(|x|)\\land\\operatorname{space}_M(x)\\le cS(|x|)\\right)\\right]\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1491,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-290","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tisp]]、[[28-thm-sat-time-space-tradeoff]]、[[28-prop-ph-complement-duality]]、[[28-prop-ph-level-inclusions]]。"},{"id":"91493cff84d506fb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SAT}$ 是本目录固定显式公式编码的可满足性语言，见 [[28-df-sat]]；$\\mathrm{TISP}$ 见 [[28-df-tisp]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","256220eba4eba968","b5d4fc2d291ce98b"]}